[style name="VisualNovelDialogueStyle"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/WITCH BG.png" fade="2.0"]

# #audio music "res://assets/music/VN music.wav"

[i]You approach the clean-looking house. Smoke rises from its chimney as a waft of herbs and strangely isopropyl alcohol hits your nose[/i]

[i]You ring the doorbell[/i]
audio "res://assets/sfx/Witch Doorbell.wav"

join WITCH center


[i]The door swings open to a black robed figure wearing a bird mask.[/i]

[i]She beckons you inside as she returns to toiling her cauldron, bubbling with strange liquids and smells[/i]

WITCH: “Hello. You are a new patient, am I correct? Luck is on your side then, for I am available for one last checkup.”

WITCH: “Tell me what you need—and keep it brief. “  WITCH\: “You may be my patient, but I have other matters to attend to”

MC: “Uhm… Trick or treat?”

WITCH: “Interesting. But a patient does not receive a treat until after the appointment, no?”

[i]She fishes for the bonesaw strapped to her belt, and starts to idly polish its blade. [/i]

[i]Both her goggles and the sharp metal gleam under the dim lighting—her intentions are clear[/i]

MC: (Gulp)
audio music "res://assets/music/Witch Perfect Loop.wav"

[signal arg="battle_ui"]

# #START BATTLE
# #ROUND 1
WITCH: “Let’s make this quick”
- Is this legit?
	MC: Shouldn’t I tell you my symptoms first?!
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “I’ll know your symptoms better if I see it for myself”

- Doctors fear one thing…
	MC: BOO AN APPLE!!!
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “An apple would do well for a potion, but something tells me the only apples you’d have are uselessly candied”

- This feels all too sudden,
	MC: A family doctor should be more personal…
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “Family doctor? I just met you”

- Let’s parry blade to blade
	MC: Two can play this game, give me a scalpel
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join WITCH (happy) center
	WITCH: “Hm? Interested in the medical field I see?”
	join WITCH (default) center
[b]{reaction_1}[/b]

# #ROUND 2
WITCH: “Do not frustrate me. Come closer”
- Attend to your pot first!
	MC: It might boil over
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join WITCH (happy) center
	WITCH: “And this is why I wished for you to be quick”
	join WITCH (default) center

- (Play a fool)
	MC: Look in the mirror! There’s a bird on your face!
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “If I allowed a bird in here, everything would be contaminated.“
	WITCH: “(My cat is an exception of course, hahaha.)”

- Who approved these methods?
	MC: Medical malpractice could leave you with a bad reputation!
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “…I live on the outskirts of town.”
	WITCH: “Did you think it matters?”

- Don’t mess with me, lady!
	MC: Let’s see who’ll need medical attention more once I splash a potion in your face
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “The potion you’re holding cannot be absorbed through the skin”
[b]{reaction_2}[/b]

# #ROUND 3
[i]You’re backed against the door. You attempt to twist the doorknob but your trembling hands fail to grip it[/i]

What is your last resort?
- Forget me, what about…
	MC: Wouldn’t an adult cadaver be more interesting?
	set {choice_id} = "A"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “Cadaver? A doctor saves people, how would I save a cadaver?”

- I’m just a little fella…
	MC: … you wouldn’t kill a lil fella…?
	set {choice_id} = "B"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “No, I wouldn’t kill any ‘fella’. Your jokes are quite insulting”

- This isn’t right.
	MC: It would weigh on your conscience if you killed me…
	set {choice_id} = "C"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	WITCH: “Kill you? I’m wounded, why would a doctor kill someone?”

- Take something hostage
	MC: I’ll tear apart your medical degree!
	set {choice_id} = "D"
	[signal arg="choice_made"]
	join WITCH (happy) center
	WITCH: “Haha! How sweet of you to think I have one”
	join WITCH (default) center
[b]{reaction_3}[/b]

if {outcome} == "fail":
	WITCH: “This appointment has been nothing but a waste of time.”
	[i]She takes out a skull and rattles it, the sound of crunching plastic and hard candy thunk around enticingly[/i]
	WITCH: “You won’t be receiving a treat. Not now, not after.”
	WITCH: “Was your visit here just to pester me? Have you no respect for my position?”
	WITCH: “Leave this house”
	
	[i]You leave empty handed. Unharmed, but with a sense of emptiness[/i]

elif {outcome}== "success":
	[i]She approaches you with the bonesaw[/i]
	
	MC: “P-please! I’m too young to die!”
	
	WITCH: “For goodness sake, why would you die? I am trying to reward you.”
	
	join WITCH (happy) center
	
	[i]She takes out a skull and slices its crown off with the bonesaw[/i] 
	WITCH: “I think you’re deserving of having your candy early. Now, what seems to be the matter? You came to a doctor for a real reason, correct?”
	
	MC: “No… I just wanted to trick or treat..”
	
	[i]She hums with amusement[/i]
	
	WITCH: “I find you peculiar. Please, take this”
	
	join WITCH (default) center
	
	[i]From the cauldron comes a writhing mass of ooze, which solidifies and transforms into a black cat[/i]
	WITCH: “My familiar. I’d like to watch your actions within this neighborhood. May she serve you well”
else:
	did not fail nor succeed

[signal arg="next_house"]